		(at 32 8)
		(descr "InvenSense ICS-43434 I2S MEMS microphone, 3.50x2.65x0.98mm LGA. Authored from InvenSense datasheet DS-000069 Rev 1.0 (2016-04-26), Figure 3 (pin configuration) and Figure 13 (PCB land pattern) -- fetched and verified this session, not from memory or the prior (incorrect) LGA_CAV_IVS import. GND (pin 3) simplified to a solid circular pad at the datasheet's outer ring diameter (1.625mm) rather than the true annular ring shown in Figure 13 -- electrically equivalent, but note the datasheet also calls for an actual drilled/routed acoustic port hole through the PCB at this pad's location (recommended >=0.5mm diameter) for the microphone to function -- that board-level cutout is NOT part of this footprint and must be added manually during PCB layout.")
